#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Write pantoken's agent assets for a tool into a consumer repo."
msgstr "Ovddit pantoken agentta assetsat alat dán consumer-repoon."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A specific [AgentTool](../type-aliases/AgentTool.md), or `\"all\"` for every asset."
msgstr "Eará birra [AgentTool](../type-aliases/AgentTool.md), dahká `\"all\"` maid leat bures assetat."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`)."
msgstr "Målte fállat (default `\".\"`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written."
msgstr "Fállašat mii leat rievdan."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Install one tool's assets into a repo**"
msgstr "**Installejit oktavuođa toola assetat repos**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Install every asset into the current directory**"
msgstr "**Installejit buoremus asseta olbmuid eatnigávppiin**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/isScaffoldPlatform.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether `platform` is a known [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md) or one of its aliases (e.g. `html`)."
msgstr "Geat leat `platform` oanehahtti [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md) dahje okta dan aliasaideaset (dál `html`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), and install pantoken's\nagent assets (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) into the same directory."
msgstr "Gávdno álggu-barguprojektu platformmai (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), ja installera pantokenin agentta ovddidit (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) dađistaga direktorii."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."
msgstr "Dat lea [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the scaffold's template files."
msgstr "Målmohkka direktorii (default `\".\"`). Son basenama (vai `\"pantoken-app\"` `\".\"`) boađegeavahit `{{projectName}}` scaffoldin mallafájllain."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which agent tool's assets to install alongside the scaffold (default `\"all\"`)."
msgstr "Maid agentta tööriista ovddidit installereáhput scaffoldin oallu (default `\"all\"`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written, scaffold files first."
msgstr "Dát leat lihttuid pathaid, scaffold-fájllat ovdal."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Scaffold a React starter with every agent asset installed**"
msgstr "**Gávdno React-álggu mii dutnje buot agentta ovddidit installerehuvvojit**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "Skafolda almmuhuprožekta platformma dárbbaš, pantoken redan installera ja doaimmahusat."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "Málahit direktorja (defahta `\".\"`). Su basename (vai `\"pantoken-app\"` `\".\"`-bohtos)\n  leat substituhtta ja váldde `{{projectName}}` template-fáilain."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform. `locale` (default `\"en\"`) sets the generated markup's\n  `lang`/`dir` attributes."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` Válgget mii `@pantoken/css` token-láhppi scaffolda fáilat\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), maid leat geavahan galgá platformaiguin. `cdn` váldá CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` leat ráhkadit (default jsDelivr);\n  ovddit eará platformaid vuostá). `locale` (default `\"en\"`) sáhttá settohkat genereremea markupiin\n  `lang`/`dir` atributtat."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Scaffold a React starter**"
msgstr "**Skafolda React-almmuha**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/ai` — consumer-facing agent assets for projects that *use* pantoken (not for\ndeveloping pantoken itself)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/ai` — kuluttajaleaddjiin sátnevaš agentta materiála projektain mii *geavahuvvot* pantoken (ii pantoken dávjá-olbmotvuođas)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ships an `AGENTS.md`, an `llms.txt`, editor/agent rule files (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), and\nClaude Code skills (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), plus [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / the `pantoken-ai` CLI to drop them into a consumer repo at the\nconventional paths."
msgstr "Dat boađeha `AGENTS.md`, `llms.txt`, editorra/agentta ráđaid failat (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), ja\nClaude Code skillat (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), muhto maid [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / `pantoken-ai` CLI, mii sáhttá čuovvut dát kuluttajarepo:s vuođuligu dásseheapmái."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/type-aliases/AgentTool.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An agent/editor tool pantoken can install assets for."
msgstr "Agentta/eddjottera alat, mii pantoken sáhttá installere assetaid."

