#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) turns any token IR into CSS; [css](variables/css.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` stylesheet and\n[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) is a lean variant that drops the full `--instui-icon-*` set (the ~1,777 icon data-URIs\nthat dominate the sheet) for CDN/embed delivery — ~a sixth the size over the wire. Both carry the\nelevation + focus-outline foundation (composite custom properties whose pure builders live in\n`@pantoken/utils`), so a component sheet resolves its shadows and focus ring against the token sheet\nalone. A DOM side-effect entry lives at `@pantoken/css/inject`; static files at\n`@pantoken/css/style.css` and `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) muhttá mannan mii dahká token-IR:hist CSS; [css](variables/css.md) lea valmmas `rebrand` styleshieta ja\n[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) ledje lean-varianta mii váldá guovttos `--instui-icon-*` setta (≈1 777 ikona data-URI:at)\nmii čájeha sheeta, dán CDN/embed-juvvolašvuođas — šaddet maŋis geahčen čuolmma dál. Buot deaddilit\neleváhkkus ja fokus-rávdna olggoš (komposit custom-properties mii čuovvut guovtti-buohcanat `@pantoken/utils`), nugo komponenta sheeta dovddá jehojin ja fokus-ráđđa token-sheeta váldde.\nDOM-siidda-efektu ovdamearrii lea `@pantoken/css/inject`; statička fájlain leat `@pantoken/css/style.css` ja `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."

