msgstr "Valmmas `rebrand` stylesheet-juoŋŋa (typed: konkretala tokenat mii leat `@property` registreringat)."

#: formats/css/src/variables/leanCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The lean `rebrand` stylesheet string — the full sheet minus the `--instui-icon-*` glyph tokens (the\n~1,777 icon data-URIs that make up most of [css](css.md)). Roughly a sixth the size over the wire; the\nrecommended foundation for CDN/embed delivery. Components reference only a handful of icons, shipped\nseparately as `@pantoken/components`'s `component-icons.css`; consumers who use `var(--instui-icon-*)`\nbroadly should load the full [css](css.md) (or the `icons.css` glyph sheet). See\n`@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr "Čáppat `rebrand` stylesheet-stringa — vuoigŋa sheet mainna leat birra `--instui-icon-*` gávpotokkit (guovdilis ~1 777 ikon-data-URIid mii čalmmit váldit muhto [css](css.md)). Báikkis sáhka sáhttá leat nieidda doaimmaid; ajánnada alapmi CDN/embed fápmuheapmái. Komponentat viillat earádusa gávpotit, jaš leat eret bargat maŋemuš `@pantoken/components`'s `component-icons.css`; fálaldagat mat geavahái `var(--instui-icon-*)` guovttos galggašit loaddat vuoigŋa [css](css.md) (vai `icons.css` gávpo-sheet). Ovdal `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."

