#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — build and compose pantoken plugins, with capability-aware registration."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — ráhkis ja komponera pantoken-pluginat, sáhttuheapmi-birra registrerejuvvot."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) is the modern factory: pass the hooks you implement and it returns a normal\n`PantokenPlugin` branded with the capabilities inferred from those hooks. Consumers\n(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) run [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) to warn — never error — when a plugin is\nregistered where it has no effect: a non-factoried plugin (capability checks unavailable) or a\nfactoried plugin at a stage it doesn't implement (e.g. a token-only plugin passed to `toCss`)."
msgstr "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) lea nuppi fáktori: geavaha hookat mii don implementere ja son boađe dovddast normála\n`PantokenPlugin` mii leat brandtalaš dálkkuid mii čahttuheapmái hookaid gaskkas. Oahppit\n(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) leat [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) sáhttit gielddat — ii maiddái feilat — gos plugin lea\nregistrerejuvvon gárvvis mii ii leat effektus: eatnabeaivái fáktorejuvvon plugin (sáhttuheapmi-čujuhusat ii leat) dahje\nfáktorejuvvon plugin fássas mii son ii implementere (dálak earánuppiin, nuvttá `toCss`)."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transform stages a `plugins:` array actually drives are `tokens`, `icons`, and `css`; `rehype`\n(a render-time icon resolver) and `native` (Style Dictionary) are recorded as capabilities but are\ndownstream consumers, not guarded here."
msgstr "Stageat mii `plugins:` arrái ovddideappá dá leat birra, leat `tokens`, `icons`, ja `css`; `rehype`\n(render-ávdnas ikon-ráddjá) ja `native` (Style Dictionary) leat sisašvuođa sáhttuheapmái maid leat\nalmmuhit okti, muhto dál ii leat gaskkas váhttit."

