#: packages/utils/src/functions/globalModifierSelector.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a global-utility modifier selector: `:where(*).--name.--name.--name`. The modifier class\nrepeated 3x gives the rule (0,3,0) specificity, which deterministically outranks any real 2-class\ncomponent-modifier compound (`.instui-view.-mod`, 0,2,0) regardless of source order — the `:where(*)`\nwrapper contributes zero specificity of its own, so it's purely documentation that this is a global\nmodifier, not a scoping condition. A plain class selector already matches standalone (`--mt-lg` with\nno other class) or chained onto any component, core or plugin-authored, with no per-component\nenumeration needed. Replaces the old bare-class-plus-enumerated-per-component-compound pattern\n(`globalSelectors`/`chainTargets`), which couldn't reach plugin-authored components and didn't scale\nto high-cardinality utilities like spacing."
msgstr "Buktán globala utilitehta modifier-selektora: `:where(*).--name.--name.--name`. Modifier-klassan\nge leat maŋimus 3-koda, johtolat dáiddái spesifisitehta (0,3,0), mii deterministtalaš várra šat buot reale 2-klassan\nkomponenta-modifier-kompáundda (`.instui-view.-mod`, 0,2,0) maiddái sourca-barggášii — `:where(*)`\nwrappára ii gávdno eatnamiellaš spesifisitehtta iesse, dasgo dan lea fálaldat dokumenteaddji ahte dat lea global\nmodifier, ii galggaš scoping-ášši. Buorre klassa-selektora deaddá schonnas vuođa mávsse (`--mt-lg` dahje\nii leat eará klassaid) dahje čohkkejuvvot olbmuid komponentta, core dahje plugin-juvvon, ilbmi per-komponent\nnumererasjonnabargu maid galgá. Vuoldat olda bivttas-bassa-klassan ja per-komponent numerereasta kompáundda\n(`globalSelectors`/`chainTargets`), mii in sáhte ovttas plugin-juvvon komponenttat ja in leat\neanet muhttin geavahit high-cardinality utilitehtaid, nugo spacing."

