#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/utils` — shared, upstream-free helpers used across the pantoken packages: the token\nreference resolver (with `light-dark()` handling), the two token regexes (typed via `arkregex`),\nkebab→camel case, hex-colour parsing, SVG sanitization, the pantoken spacing scale, reference-drift\nvalidation, and the generic token→utility-class emitters that both `@pantoken/components`\n(semantic tier) and `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) build on. Depends only on\n`@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, so any package can use it without pulling the GitHub-only\nupstream."
msgstr "`@pantoken/utils` — ođđa šearruheapmi, upstream-vuođđalaš ovddasvuohta, mii leat geavahit pantoken-pakčaid gaskkas: token-referánsa resolvera (`light-dark()`-man beassat), guokte token-regexat (typed via `arkregex`), kebab→camel-case muhtun, hex-värvihandán, SVG sanitearjevierruheapmi, pantoken-muhtun-škeaŋka skaala, referánsa-drift validašuvdna, ja generála token→utility-class emittearrat mii `@pantoken/components` (semantihkka tier) ja `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) boahttevarođđu. Dependerešan doarjaga doarji `@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, niin vaiđđa pakki sáhttá geavahit dan ailmmis maid ožžon GitHub-oappálaš upstream vuođđalaš."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The css-tree-backed token syntax validator lives at the separate `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`\nentry, not this barrel — `css-tree` bundles a runtime `createRequire()` JSON load that breaks when\npulled into a browser/SSR bundle, and this barrel is imported by browser-facing packages (e.g.\n`@pantoken/components`) for the Node-free helpers above."
msgstr "Css-tree-basahta token-syntax validašuvdna leat eret `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`-entryis, ii dan barrelis — `css-tree` bálvalus runtime `createRequire()` JSON-load mii válddeheapmi go dan vuođđat browser/SSR-bundlein, ja dan barrelis importerejuvvo browser-ovddas pakkanis (juohke `@pantoken/components`) dakkár Node-viđis ovddasvuohtaid gaskkas."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pure barrel — every implementation lives in its own discrete module; add new helpers there and\nre-export them here, don't grow this file."
msgstr "Puhttasne barrel — buot implementašuvnnat leat dieđe doaimmaid modulašii; addit ođđa ovddasvuođaid dort ja re-exporteár dat dár, áigut leat dat faila stuorastit."

