msgid "Jekyll has no standard theming-variable contract, so this delivers the tokens as drop-in assets:\na Sass partial for `_sass/` (import it from your main stylesheet) and a plain CSS file for\n`assets/css/` (from `@pantoken/scss` and `@pantoken/css`), plus an InstUI-look prose stylesheet\n(from `@pantoken/components`) that styles content in a `.pantoken-prose` region."
msgstr "Jekyll ii leat standardalaš theami-muhtun bargu, danbeasa dát boađe tokenat ovddideapmi assettana:\na Sass-osá `_sass/`-biktas (importere dan cealkke-stylesheet-asttimin) ja bures CSS-faila `assets/css/`-biktas (geavaheapmi `@pantoken/scss` ja `@pantoken/css`), ja InstUI-luonddu prose-stylesheet\n(geavaheapmi `@pantoken/components`) mii estiloje sisdoallu `.pantoken-prose`-regionas."

