#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-deprecations` — lifecycle-aware compatibility shims for dropped upstream tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-deprecations` — eallinráđđiiguin kompatibilitehtaš šimmat dárkiluvvon upstream-tokenáid bokte."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When an upstream release drops a `--instui-*` token, a hand-authored `DeprecationLedger`\nrecords its lifecycle: when it was deprecated, the upstream minor that will remove it, and how to\nkeep it working meanwhile — either forward to a canonical token (`replacement` → `var(...)`) or\nfreeze its last-known literal (`value`). This plugin appends one shim token per entry. Because the\nshim is a single `var(...)` or a plain value, `defineToken` records its `refersTo`/syntax and\n`toCss` emits it, so the shim rides into css/scss/less/stylus/wordpress/vanilla with no extra wiring."
msgstr "Go upstream-ráidušeaddji måtta `--instui-*`-token, dá leat oktavuođa-birget `DeprecationLedger`\nmii dáid eallinráđđiiguin doaibmá: go dat lea deprekahttaš, mii upstream-minora mii maid ferte dán maid, ja mo veahkeheapmi\nráhkadit dat rievddu — jearrat dál canonála tokeniid (`replacement` → `var(...)`) dahkat\nvájuhit olbmui-čuovgga (`value`). Dán plugin addá ovddit ovtta shim-tokena aeddus. Dasgo\nshim lea ovtta `var(...)` dahje lihtteat nilai, `defineToken` čállá sikku `refersTo`/syntaksi ja\n`toCss` geavahit dan, dan maŋŋá shim bargá css/scss/less/stylus/wordpress/vanillain ilman extra-vuordit."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The retirement is enforced elsewhere (the upgrade pipeline hard-fails a bump once an entry's\n`removeIn` upstream minor is reached, forcing the entry to be retired and a consumer minor cut).\n[dueForRemoval](functions/dueForRemoval.md) is the check that powers it; [describeLifecycle](functions/describeLifecycle.md) powers the docs."
msgstr "Riegádan lea gávdnat ovttas muhtun (upgrade-pipeline ledje-failsa get geavahallat ovttat go aeddus `removeIn`-upstream-minora sáhttá eatnemeamit, mii force ráhkadit aeddusat riegáda ja consumer-minora geavat).\n[dueForRemoval](functions/dueForRemoval.md) lea bargguide mii geahččala dan; [describeLifecycle](functions/describeLifecycle.md) geahččala dokumentasjona."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
