#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-visual-debug` — the CSS for InstUI's `withVisualDebug` prop."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-visual-debug` — CSS InstUI‑gii `withVisualDebug`‑propma."

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI's layout primitives (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) take `withVisualDebug` to outline the box\nand its children while debugging a layout. This plugin emits a single dash-prefixed modifier,\n`-with-visual-debug`, that works on any element (compound with any base, e.g.\n`.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). The outline colour is a `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` custom property\n(default a bright magenta) so it's easy to retint."
msgstr "InstUI‑gii layout‑primitivsat (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) boađeheapmi `withVisualDebug` ahte oaivvildit boxa ja johtit gullan go layout dahká. Dát plugin vuolaš okta mihttu dash‑prefikseara modifier, `-with-visual-debug`, mii bargá bures elementtas (kompounda buori almmuhus, d.e. `.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). Outline‑vuohta lea `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` custom‑property (default lea čáje magenta) nu maid leat eanan rievdadit."

