msgid "The plugin expands built-in `--theme-*` and `--breakpoint-*` aliases, prunes non-target theme\nbranches, strips matching `theme:*` clauses from kept queries, unwraps always-true theme-only media\nwrappers, and removes `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` declarations from emitted CSS."
msgstr "Pluggain leage vuođđahan buohkat `--theme-*` ja `--breakpoint-*` aliasat, muoká eai-bargga tema\nosaid, sihttá `theme:*` báhpat mii bargguheapmi čállin, vuosttaheapmi almmuhahtti true tema-olbmot media\nwrapperaid ja fásttá `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` deklarasjonaid čálliheapmái CSS-st."

