#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vite-workspace-orchestrator` — a Vite dev-server plugin that watches upstream workspace\npackages and rebuilds them (and their dependents) when source changes."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vite-workspace-orchestrator` — Vite dev-server-plugin mii eará ovttas workspace-pakčaid hállá ja čalbmaheapmi daid (ja deras dependentaid) go sourca muhtun."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "During development, changes to a local workspace package normally need a manual rebuild before the\ndev server reflects them. This plugin automates that: it watches each upstream package's source\nwith native `fs.watch` (not Vite's chokidar, which filters paths outside the project root),\ndebounces rapid changes, rebuilds in topological order, and registers built output with Vite's\nwatcher so the browser reloads. In pantoken's docs it keeps the generated CSS (`@pantoken/css`,\n`@pantoken/components`) fresh as you edit the libraries, instead of only at build time."
msgstr "Gii álgásašhaga, muhtun birra lokaala workspace-pakkaide dihte bivddot mannat manuálaš čalbmaheapmi go dev-server válddeha daid. Dát plugin automatiserá dan: se hállá juo váldit pakkan sourca ovttas `fs.watch`-muvvan (in Vite chokidar, mii filtrear projektaruođa máŋgaid maŋŋilinnaid), deabuontas borrat muhtunat, čalbmaheapmi topologalaš ordna, ja registrere čalbmahttu output Vite watcher-ii go browser reload-eađđá. Pantoken-dokkaid sisdoaimmain se álggahusas CSS (`@pantoken/css`, `@pantoken/components`) nuppi ja muohtaš go don edit-eat kirjástuid, ii doarvái ođđa buvttadeaddji čalbmaheapmi."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It applies during `serve` only, so production builds are untouched."
msgstr "Dát galggá doarjjet birra `serve`-aiguin maŋŋebárdni, dasgo prodüksuvdnabeaivvi čalbmat eai leat válddán."

