msgstr "Vuhkkin transformasuvdna mii lea bargguheaddji URL-relative mátkkoža davvisága máŋga dahje `serveDir`-in oassá, nu: \n`(p) => p.replace(//([^/]+)\\.css$/, \"/$1/app.css\")`."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [workspaceOrchestrator](../functions/workspaceOrchestrator.md)."
msgstr "Válgat [workspaceOrchestrator](../functions/workspaceOrchestrator.md) dahje."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream workspace dependency graph."
msgstr "Álmmuheapmi upstream-workspace-dependenssa grafas."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Paths to watch with native `fs.watch` so Vite picks up built output after an upstream rebuild\n(e.g. a package's `dist` or `generated` directory). Uses native `fs.watch` rather than\nchokidar's `add()`, which doesn't reliably detect changes in pnpm-symlinked or out-of-root\ndirectories. On each change a synthetic `\"change\"` event is emitted on `server.watcher`: for\nCSS files already in the module graph Vite triggers a targeted hot-update; for anything else\nit falls back to a full page reload."
msgstr "Paths mii galgget oahppat nugo njuovčča `fs.watch` dahje Vite veahkehahtá bures dávviriid buktit maŋŋil upstream-rebuild\n(e.g. paketii `dist` dahje `generated` kataloga). Geavahusaččat nugo `fs.watch` ovttasmaid\nchokidar `add()`-st, mii ii leat čállán mearras muitalit maid geavahan pnpm-symlinkteappaid dahje guovlluid\nbuktidihtii. Juohke sáhttit ođđaiguin synthetic `\"change\"` eará `server.watcher`-s: CSS fállat mii already leat modul-grafas Vite bidjá sihkejuvvon hot-update; muhto muhto muitalaš buvttadeamis\ngeat leat vejolaš gaskanuvvon fuolahallat seamma sidadus."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Debounce delay in milliseconds before triggering a rebuild (default: 200)."
msgstr "Debounce-vižžo millisekundain geažilvuoddji eanet geažesohkái rebuildi (default: 200)."

