msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — teama Foundation for Sites mii báhppes Instructure-tokenain."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation lea Sass-viđáš, de dat pakettta dahká guokte lávddut. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) vuođaheaddje `_settings`-stáhtta Sass-partiala mii vierru Foundationin seaddevarriabargguid `var(--instui-*)`-dego, nu ahte Sass-ruvvet vuođđuduvvo Instructure geavaheaddji maid keepte runtime-teemid ovttas samma eará geavahallan. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) vuođaheaddje ođđa CSS-olmmošmáilmmu mii teema muital ahte geavat suodjalit dássáš compile-riesuheapmi luođaid (`.button`, `.callout`, links) das boahtá dárbbašit go máŋggašet Foundation CSS-nusat ja leat bargat Instructure fargguid addit ovttas dálkkodit, ii rekombilahttu."

