#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — a markdown-it plugin that renders `:icon:` codes as inline SVG and\nstandalone color values (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) as swatches, using the pantoken icon\nset."
msgstr "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — markdown-it-plugán mii ráđđá `:icon:` koodat nugo inline SVG ja\novttaservuheapmi fargguvuodjat (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) nugo svatšat, geavahit pantoken ikonu\nsetta."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ports the `@pantoken/rehype` and `@pantoken/react-markdown` pipelines onto markdown-it: a\nsingle core rule walks each inline token's text children, splits them on the icon and color\npatterns, and swaps the matches for `html_inline` tokens. Icon codes resolve through a chain —\nplugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve), then the\nbuilt-in `@pantoken/icons` set — so brand-icon plugins compose the same way they do elsewhere."
msgstr "Dat porterear `@pantoken/rehype` ja `@pantoken/react-markdown` pipeline-rádjid markdown-itin: ovtta core-rievtta čállá ovtta inline-tokenain tekstabirra, dieđii dihte dálkká ikon- ja farggu-mátkkuid, ja válddá matchingat `html_inline` tokenain. Ikon-koodat vuogá maŋemus — plugána `rehype` resolverat ovttas, dego juohke vuostta [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve), ja maŋemus-buot `@pantoken/icons` setta — das lea dássávuohta go brand-icon plugánaid komponerehkii sama boddu mii guoská muohttit."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The emitted markup uses the same class names as the other renderers (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), so loading `@pantoken/components` styles it. Wrap the rendered HTML in a\n`.pantoken-prose` container (see [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) to pick up the prose layer too."
msgstr "Emiterejuvvon markup geavahit sama class-namme mii otná rendereraid (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), so dat šaddá `@pantoken/components` styles. Vuordit renderadda HTML `.pantoken-prose` containeriin (borra [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) mainna muitalit prose-layeriid geavahit."

