#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — Instructure-stáilta globála stilmádat Pendo guovdilisvuođain."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs, and an `instui-banner` prefix extends the\nbanner surface to popovers and surveys while keeping their overlay elevation."
msgstr "Pendo čeajaha giidat-HTML:a vastái vuoddain siidai; dás ovdal giidat DOM (`._pendo-*`) maŋŋel\nInstructure UI, pantoken's geavahit `--instui-*` token-loahppa bargguheamaid maŋŋa. Dat gullá responsive\nbadjeluođa ja mare giidat-jođiheamit dieđusteami, dihtovuođa, árvaleami, ja kontrolllat. The\ncomponent CSS lea šallendihte `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken vahkka tokens ja the\nassembly. Okta geavvalaš tema-klassa maidna `instui` aktivere mearkkáhuvvan stylesheet; dikšu\nsuffixat dás klassas vállje giidat-loahppa barggat ja glyphtat, ja an `instui-banner` prefix viidde the\nbanner surface popovers ja árvaleapmiide maŋŋa guođevuođa."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composee stilmádat; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) lea valmmas `rebrand` build (skooppaš, `!important`). Statiš fájl publiseruvvii osohas `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."

