msgid "The resolver wired into `ctx.iconSvg` — pass [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) for real icons\n  or [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) when the caller's element set provably never renders one (see\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` in `./elements-meta.ts`)."
msgstr "Resolvera mii leat válddame `ctx.iconSvg`-in — gávdnet [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) geavaheaddji-ikonáidna válbmiidealuid dahkat, vai [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) go callerin elamenttasett dáhpáhuslaš ii ollu oaidnán duohttalihttuheapmi (geahččat `ICON_ELEMENTS` `./elements-meta.ts`-is)."

