#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-rating>` — a star rating with `role=\"img\"`. `value` is the number of filled stars, `max`\nthe total (default 5), and `label` overrides the accessible name (defaults to `value/max`). Stars\nrender as inline SVG glyphs (solid = filled), sized to the text."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-rating&gt;` — a star rating with `role=\"img\"`. `value` is the number of filled stars, `max`\nthe total (default 5), and `label` overrides the accessible name (defaults to `value/max`). Stars\nrender as inline SVG glyphs (solid = filled), sized to the text."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ru.md
