msgid "`<instui-side-nav-bar>` — the styled shell of a vertical navigation rail. `minimized=\"true\"` adds\nthe `-minimized` modifier (collapsed rail); the consumer slots the nav items."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-side-nav-bar&gt;` — the styled shell of a vertical navigation rail. `minimized=\"true\"` adds\nthe `-minimized` modifier (collapsed rail); the consumer slots the nav items."

