#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
#~ msgstr "✅ Use Wrapper goassige:"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
#~ msgstr "- Maid leat bargguid Canvas product-sággis, mii boađeheapmi dihtii ođđa dássái/layout-shell\n- Ságge čállá GlobalNav main navigation-ankára\n- Ságge dihte sidda panelat: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, dahje UtilityPanel\n- Dihtii ožžonjuvvon konteinera paddin ja contentin max-width vuostta ságga nieðđus\n🚫 Ávkkáš doalu Wrapper goassige:"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
#~ msgstr "- Maid leat bargguid Modal, Tray, dahje Drawer — dasat leat ođđa layout-konteineraid\n- Vuordit ságga suohkanosán dihtii — Wrapper boađeheapmi mannat ságga buoremus, ii skuvlla"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
#~ msgstr "- Kartte main content-álbmogiid &lt;main&gt; landmarkta dahje skip-nav-link, nu mana klávat-buorrege keyboard-geažis leat mii oktavuođas GlobalNav\n- Adda ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" ja eret aria-label maŋŋil \"Page navigation\" — eret GlobalNav landmarktast\n- Adda TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" ja sprevialearia-label mii deattuhit suvuheapmi, mo don dálkkehuvvan \"Student details\"\n- Adda kárta UtilityPanelaid eret aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", dahje \"Filters\"\n- Go UtilityPanel oššehuvvá, liiká fokus paneliin; go son liiko, boasat fokus dálke triggeri mii oššehis paneliid"

