#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
#~ msgstr "Pendo injecteeraa guovdilisvuođas HTML:ta host-sida; dan ráhkadit dan guovdilisvuođa DOM (`._pendo-*`) mii sáhttá ostat Instructure UI:s, geavahit pantokenin `--instui-*` token-layeri dovddus. Dat boađeha responsiivalaš lila ja miera banner-guovdilisvuođaid trattementa maid oktageahtá alertaid, popoveraid, surveya ja kontrollda. Komponenta CSS lea porttodat `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken dáhkká tokenat ja assembláža. Oassin theme-luokta mii obsahha `instui` aktivera dihtii skooppaš stilmádat; kompakta suffiksa dan luoktii váldde banner fargáid ja gálgográfuid."

